{#
  The « Prix » box of a modification (#927, chantier §2.3), on its own page
  — it used to sit on Finances, every line editable.

  **The tariff's lines are read only**: they are recomputed from the dates
  and the participants at every save, so what a renter is asked to pay can
  always be explained line by line. The one thing typed by hand is a single
  « Remise » — a label and the amount deducted, typed without a sign (a
  phone's decimal keypad has none) and stored as a negative line, like the
  settlement's « Geste commercial ». No line is edited, none is
  added, nothing is « recalculé » by hand. A discount granted after the stay
  is a « Geste commercial » of the final settlement instead, with no new
  contract.

  Rendered inside the modification's form when `editable`, so the discount
  posts with the dates.

  Requires `quote` (a Pricing\PriceQuote), `editable` and
  `max_discount_label_length`; optional `discount`, the discount line in
  force (Pricing\PriceLine).
#}
{% set discount_line = quote.lines|filter(l => l.rule == 'discount')|first %}
<div class="card mb-3" id="prix">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Prix</h2>
        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="table table-sm align-middle mb-2">
                <caption class="visually-hidden">Lignes du prix de la location</caption>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">Ligne</th>
                        <th scope="col" class="text-end">Qté</th>
                        <th scope="col" class="text-end">Prix unitaire</th>
                        <th scope="col" class="text-end">Montant</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for line in quote.lines|filter(l => l.rule != 'discount') %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                {{ line.label }}
                                {% if line.isInformational %}
                                    <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block">Facturé sur relevé — hors total</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                            <td class="text-end">{{ line.quantity }}</td>
                            <td class="text-end">{{ line.unitPriceCents is not null ? line.unitPriceCents|money_cents : '—' }}</td>
                            <td class="text-end">{{ line.amountCents|money_cents }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                    {% if editable %}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="3">
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'discount-label', field_name: 'discount_label',
                                    label: 'Remise — libellé', size: 'sm', wrapper_class: 'mb-0',
                                    value: discount_line ? discount_line.label : '',
                                    maxlength: max_discount_label_length,
                                    placeholder: 'Remise fidélité',
                                } only %}
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                                    field_id: 'discount-amount', field_name: 'discount_amount',
                                    label: 'Montant déduit (€)', size: 'sm', wrapper_class: 'mb-0',
                                    value: discount_line ? (discount_line.amountCents|abs / 100)|number_format(2, ',', '') : '',
                                    inputmode: 'decimal', placeholder: '50,00',
                                } only %}
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    {% elseif discount_line %}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="3">{{ discount_line.label }}</td>
                            <td class="text-end">{{ discount_line.amountCents|money_cents }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                </tbody>
                <tfoot>
                    <tr class="fw-semibold">
                        <td colspan="3">Total de la location</td>
                        <td class="text-end">{{ quote.totalCents|money_cents }}</td>
                    </tr>
                </tfoot>
            </table>
        </div>
        <p class="form-text mb-0">
            Les lignes du tarif se recalculent seules à partir des dates et des participants ; seule la remise se
            saisit à la main. Après le séjour, un geste commercial se fait au décompte final.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
